#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/aci.rst:67
msgid ""
"From the EPG drop down, either an existing EPG can be selected or a new one "
"can be created. It is the same for ANP, either create a new one or choose an"
" existing."
msgstr ""
"Desde el EPG drop down, either un existente EPG puede be seleccionado o un "
"nuevo one se puede crear. It es el mismo para ANP, either create un nuevo "
"one o choose un existente."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/aci.rst:68
msgid ""
"Under ACI security consumes and provides, contracts can be searched when you"
" enter a name. When the provisioning wizard is completed, it will provision "
"the instance and apply the ACI options and Security. This can be viewed "
"under the instance page, or via REST API and CLI."
msgstr ""
"Under ACI security consumes y provides, contracts puede be searched cuando "
"you enter un nombre. When el provisioning wizard es completed, it será "
"provision la instancia y apply el ACI opciones y Security. This se puede ver"
" under la instancia página, o via REST API y CLI."

